  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "這是你今天第三次睡醒，早安老陳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我昏迷了多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "十幾秒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "——星熊，讓開。我來切碎積石。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不好意思，我不能讓。讓這麼一下，你我可能就都沒了。我不要緊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你的胳膊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不要緊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......你撐不了多久！至少有兩層樓的廢墟壓在你的盾上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我不用撐多久。現在你醒了就好辦了，蹲下，你要隨時準備好衝出去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "無論有多重——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "——只要能被我掀開——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "——就也沒多重！！啊啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈，哈……哎呀，只是這樣推一下，這隻手臂竟然就真的不行了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你又救了我一次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "很奇怪嗎，我救你的次數還少嗎？就別鄭重其事地說出來了，我聽著不舒服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "讓我歇一會，我覺得全身骨頭都散了......偶爾也允許我動彈不得一回吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "......該死，這樣還沒辦法幹掉近衛局嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "但敵人不允許。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "這就沒辦法了。看來還是得勉強站起來動一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你快去整頓隊伍。別被這些人拖住腳步，他們就是幹這個的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我覺得先處理掉他們也不遲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你就不能先去看還有什麼人受傷了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "然後留你一身傷，獨自面對整合運動？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "老陳。你以為你在做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "兩年前在下水，你自己去追的匪首。我腿腳受了傷，但你很信任我，你留下我一個人戰鬥。你還記得嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "那次我追了他多長時間？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "三個小時。你可以信任我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "現在也一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你們，整合運動！一齊上吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "可惡，居然挑釁我們！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我還能戰鬥。為什麼這次你要留在這裡，為什麼不去率隊奪回近衛局？這難道不才是首要任務嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "現在和三年前沒有區別，你依然扛著只有你才能做的事情！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "剛才在木禾倉庫也是，你什麼時候變得那麼婆媽？老陳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我不覺得保護自己的同事不受暴徒侵害有什麼問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你變了。以前的你是更剛強的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "把你丟在這裡？當然可以。只不過我以前權衡的是利弊，但現在，就像你說的那樣——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "把阿米婭他們留在廢城這件事，我也一樣感到......不適。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "你們會嘗到感染者的憤怒的！上啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "也許我確實變了。時間久了，我對龍門的不滿越來越少，相信我的人也越來越多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你也不再僅僅是星熊督察了，你是我的朋友，我的搭檔，星熊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你的盾，你替我撐了這麼久；偶爾也要允許我做一回你的盾牌，星熊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "嘩。你說這話臉都不紅一下的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "*龍門粗口*。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "算了，行吧。行啊，老陳，都聽你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
